<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Patient Registration & Identity</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            The foundation of the clinical record—maintaining the absolute integrity of patient 
            identity and insurance eligibility from the first point of contact.
        </p>
    </div>
