<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Master Patient Index (MPI) Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate duplicate records and patient mix-ups with a robust Master Patient Index. 
            The Registration module utilizes advanced phonetic and NID-based matching to 
            search for existing records before creating new ones. Every patient is 
            assigned a unique, immutable hospital number, creating the permanent anchor 
            for their longitudinal health record. Comprehensive demographics—including 
            contacts, next-of-kin, and employer details—are captured in a structured 
            database, ensuring that the facility has the critical communication 
            links needed for care coordination.
        </p>
        <p>
            Secure digital consent capture ensures that the facility is compliant with 
            patient data protection standards and ethical clinical requirements from 
            inception.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Biometric Identification & Safety</h2>
        <p>
            Enhance patient safety through biometric verification. The system supports 
            fingerprint and facial identification routines, allowing for the rapid 
            recall of the correct health record even when patients are unable to 
            communicate or provide identification documents. This high-integrity 
            link between the physical patient and their digital history is a 
            critical safeguard against clinical errors in the pharmacy or lab.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Real-Time Medical Aid Verification</h2>
        <p>
            Drive revenue cycle efficiency by verifying insurance eligibility at the front desk. 
            Integrate directly with medical aid providers like CIMAS, PSMAS, and Premier 
            to check membership status, available limits, and waiting periods instantly. 
            Automated capturing of medical aid cards and authorization numbers ensure 
            that claims are pre-validated before clinical services are rendered, 
            significantly reducing subsequent claim rejections and bad debt 
            exposure.
        </p>
        <p>
            The system manages complex corporate and embassy accounts, maintaining 
            specific billing rules and credit limits for institutional patients.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

